 Section BC Q108: Installation of Smoke Control SystemsSmoke control systems, where required by this code, shall be installed in accordance with NFPA 92, Standard for Smoke Control Systems , 2018 edition, modified for New York City as follows. Refer to the rules of the department for any subsequent additions, modifications or deletions that may have been made to this standard in accordance with Section 28-103.19 of the Administrative Code .

 Chapter 1 Administration 

